# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository.
#
# The baseline commit was made with core.autocrlf=true, so every blob is LF
# while several working files were left CRLF. Editing one then rendered as a
# whole-file rewrite — jobpipe/cli.py showed 1,075 deleted lines for a 32-line
# change. Pinning it here means the question never comes up again.
* text=auto eol=lf
